---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="About AG Cambodia, Insurance Broker since 2006"
  description="At AG Cambodia, our mission is simple – to safeguard what matters most to our clients. Whether you're looking for personal health insurance or comprehensive"
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span>About Us</span>
      </nav>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">About AG Insurance Broker</p>
      <h1>Your Trusted Insurance Broker Since 2006</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Founded in 2006, AG Insurance Broker has been at the forefront of the Cambodian insurance market, offering a wide range of insurance products and expert consultancy services tailored to the unique needs of individuals and businesses across the Kingdom.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founded / mission -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article-grid">
      <div class="article-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
        <h2>20 years of integrity and reliability</h2>
        <p>Founded in 2006, AG Insurance Broker has been at the forefront of the Cambodian insurance market, offering a wide range of insurance products and expert consultancy services tailored to the unique needs of individuals and businesses across the Kingdom. With over 20 years of experience, we've built a reputation for integrity, reliability, and customer-centric service. Our team of dedicated professionals works closely with leading international and local insurers, ensuring our clients receive the best protection and the most competitive rates.</p>
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>At AG Cambodia, our mission is simple — to safeguard what matters most to our clients. Whether you're looking for personal health insurance or comprehensive business insurance solutions, our commitment is to provide you with unparalleled support and guidance throughout the entire process, from selecting the right coverage to making a claim.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="peril-card">
        <h3>AG Cambodia at a glance</h3>
        <ul class="peril-list">
          <li>Founded in 2006</li>
          <li>20+ years of experience</li>
          <li>800+ clients protected</li>
          <li>15+ insurer partners</li>
          <li>24/7 claims support</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why choose us -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why choose AG Cambodia?</p>
      <h2>What sets us apart</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Five principles guide every policy we place and every claim we handle.</p>

      <div class="cov-grid">
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="18" r="2.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><path d="M7.8 7.6 10.5 16M16.2 7.6 13.5 16M8.4 6h7.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Extensive Network of Insurers</h3>
          <p>We work with a broad range of reputable insurers, giving you access to a variety of coverage options.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle></svg></span>
          <h3>Tailored Insurance Solutions</h3>
          <p>No two clients are alike. We take the time to understand your needs and craft personalized solutions that fit your lifestyle or business requirements.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 4h16v12H9l-5 4V4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 9h8M8 12h5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Exceptional Customer Service</h3>
          <p>Our clients are at the heart of everything we do. With AG Cambodia, you're never just a policy number — we offer prompt, knowledgeable service at every stage of your journey.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 21V8l8-5 8 5v13M9 21v-6h6v6M4 21h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Expertise Across Sectors</h3>
          <p>Whether you're an individual seeking international health insurance, a business owner needing property and casualty insurance, or a corporate client requiring tailored risk management, we've got you covered.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></rect><path d="M8 8h.01M8 12h.01M8 16h8M12 8h4M12 12h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Innovative Technology</h3>
          <p>Our team continuously adopts modern technologies to streamline processes, from easy-to-understand policy options to efficient claims handling.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Legacy of trust -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">A legacy of trust</p>
      <h2>Thousands protected, and counting</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Since our inception, we have successfully helped thousands of individuals, families, and businesses secure the insurance coverage they need, protecting their financial future and providing peace of mind. We are proud of our longstanding relationships with both our clients and partners, as well as our continued role in supporting Cambodia's growing insurance market.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Commitment to Cambodia -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our commitment to Cambodia</p>
      <h2>A homegrown company, giving back</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">As a homegrown Cambodian company, AG Insurance Broker is committed to contributing to the social and economic development of the country. We believe in giving back to the community through various initiatives, including supporting education, local healthcare initiatives, and providing insurance awareness programs to underserved areas. We are proud to be a trusted partner in Cambodia's progress, offering financial protection to empower both individuals and businesses.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact / Quote -->
  <section class="section quote-section" id="contact">
    <div class="container quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Get a quote</p>
        <h2>Your free quote within 24 hours</h2>
        <p class="section-lead section-lead-light">Tell us about your business or situation. Compare offers from multiple insurers with clear, professional advice.</p>
        <ul class="check-list check-list-light">
          <li>We compare 15+ insurers to get you the best rate</li>
          <li>Available in French and English</li>
          <li>Officially licensed and registered in Cambodia</li>
          <li>Fully confidential — your request is never spammed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="quote-cta-row">
          <a href="https://t.me/AGCambodia" class="btn btn-outline-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 4 3 11l6 2m12-9-4 16-8-6m0 0 3-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Telegram
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.4 2.8 3.8 5.2 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.9 21 3 13.1 3 3.5c0-.6.4-1 1-1H7.7c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.4 0 .8-.2 1L6.6 10.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Call us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-form-card">
        <p class="quote-form-title">Company &amp; get covered</p>
        <p class="quote-form-sub">Tell us a bit about your needs and a broker will call you back within 24 hours.</p>

        <div class="quote-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Insurance type">
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Health Insurance</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Vehicle</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Property</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Other</button>
        </div>

        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="firstName">First name *</label>
              <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" required autocomplete="given-name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="lastName">Last name *</label>
              <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" required autocomplete="family-name" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email *</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp *</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Request my free quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-note">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
            Your information is 100% confidential
          </p>
          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
